				{
					"id": 210310401,
					"content": "你们回来了，哎哟…那些魔物真是难对付…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210310402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "淮安"
				},
				{
					"id": 210310402,
					"content": "你把那些魔物都打倒了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210310403
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210310403,
					"content": "哈哈哈，是的，颇费了一番功夫，年纪大了终归是有些力不从心啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210310404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "淮安"
				},
				{
					"id": 210310404,
					"content": "您应该也已经把那些魔物都解决掉了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210310405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "淮安"
				},
				{
					"id": 210310405,
					"content": "关于魔物营地…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210310406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210310406,
					"content": "魔物全都被打倒了…但是营地里却没有人影？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210310407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "淮安"
				},
				{
					"id": 210310407,
					"content": "这倒是怪了，难道是哪位路过的冒险家，顺手打倒了那些魔物？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210310408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "淮安"
				},
				{
					"id": 210310408,
					"content": "总之，还是谢谢您帮我去周围巡查，这些报酬请您收下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "淮安"
				}
